{"id":"ba03a59c8208ec05","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-uls.md","title":"Ultrafilter Limit","display":"thm-uls — Ultrafilter Limit","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-uls","aliases":["58-thm-uls"],"display":"thm-uls — Ultrafilter Limit","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[58-df-limit]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-uls"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-uls</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uls — Ultrafilter Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68fb21596025bb57\" href=\"?note=68fb21596025bb57\" title=\"58-df-limit\">58-df-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (compact Hausdorff space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3639c3f839b6c954\" href=\"?note=3639c3f839b6c954\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:\\omega\\to X\">\\(x:\\omega\\to X\\)</span> (sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S\\)</span> (compact-Hausdorff predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uls}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\to\\exists!\\ell\\in X\\;\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\\ell\\in V\\to\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\in V\\}\\in U\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uls}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\to\\exists!\\ell\\in X\\;\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\\ell\\in V\\to\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\in V\\}\\in U\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compactness gives existence of an ultrafilter limit, while the Hausdorff condition gives uniqueness.</li>\n<li>Without compactness, a sequence need not have a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-limit in its codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limit","status":"resolved","id":"68fb21596025bb57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ (ultrafilter on $\\omega$, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"3639c3f839b6c954","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\tau)$ (compact Hausdorff space, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-topo8-compact-hausdorff-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (ultrafilter predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"x:\\omega\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uls}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8CompactHausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(x,\\omega,X)\\to\\exists!\\ell\\in X\\;\\forall V\\in\\tau\\;\\left(\\ell\\in V\\to\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\in V\\}\\in U\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1307,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4470","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-uls.md|58-thm-uls]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","68fb21596025bb57","3639c3f839b6c954","36d7463d215be751"]}